<p><img id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_imgHelpBill" class="ux-img-valign " src="../../../Stylesheets/Images/help_0.gif">
<span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_lblBill">Bill or resolution</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_lblBillAnswer">Yes</span></b></p>

<p><span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_ucBill_lblGoalDescription">Describe your lobbying goal(s) in detail.  What are you attempting to influence or accomplish as a result of your communications with Ontario public office holders?</span></p>
<p><span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_ucBill_txtGoalDescription">Communications with government regarding Bill 40, Protect Ontario by Securing Affordable Energy for Generations Act, 2025, in order to support economic priorities, as well as the connection of specified load facilities.</span></p>
