<span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_lblPolicyProgram">Policy and/or program</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_lblPolicyProgramAnswer">Yes</span></b></p>

<p><span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_ucPolicyProgram_lblGoalDescription">Describe your lobbying goal(s) in detail.  What are you attempting to influence or accomplish as a result of your communications with Ontario public office holders?</span></p>
<p><span id="BodyContent_ucRegistrationSubmit_LobbyingActivity_ucPolicyProgram_txtGoalDescription">Communications with government to support Ontario’s digital economy, including policies or programs that promote innovation, the digital economy, internet connectivity, Al and cloud infrastructure, digital and AI adoption, digital and AI skills. 
Communications with government concerning technology policy, including privacy and data protection, cybersecurity, development and applications of artificial intelligence and the ethical use of artificial intelligence, accessibility policy as it relates to technology, industry efforts, and global experiences in technology, energy and environmental sustainability as they relate to technology.

Communications with government to explore the adoption of cloud-based solutions and Al technologies, and related support services for both the private and public sectors. Communications with government to share information concerning policies or programs on procurement modernization, as it relates to the standards, terms, conditions and policies that underpin the Government of Ontario's procurement of enterprise ICT products and services, including cloud-based services.

Communications with government regarding the Canadian counter-tariffs and U.S. trade measures where they pertain to digital trade, such as technology products, services, and supply chains under the Canada-United States-Mexico Agreement (CUSMA).

Communications with government about the use of Microsoft cloud- and AI-based information technology services to the Government of Ontario.</span></p>
